{
  title: "accept_prompt"
}
---
### NAME

    accept_prompt() - Determines whether a response to a prompt is an
    acceptance.

### SYNOPSIS

    int accept_prompt( string str );

### DESCRIPTION

    Determines whether a response to a prompt is an acceptance.

    Case is ignored, so "Y" and "Yes" answer as readily as their lowercase
    forms. Anything else is not an acceptance, including the empty string a
    bare enter arrives as.

### PARAMETERS

    str  (string)
         The response to test.

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) 1 if the response accepts, 0 if not.

### EXAMPLE

    {{di1}}accept_prompt("Yes") // 1
    accept_prompt("no")  // 0
    accept_prompt("wat") // 0{{di0}}
